WEBVTT

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.496
nikaamua kulenga kitu kimoja tu.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.336
Kitu ambacho siwezi kuishi nikikikosa:

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.590
kikombe changu cha kahawa asubuhi.

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:08.056
Basi, ikasemekana
kua sio rahisi kabisa.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:09.096
(Kicheko)

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.735
Hii safari imenichukua miezi.

00:02:10.759 --> 00:02:13.216
Imenizungusha duniani.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:18.696
Kwa sababu niligundua
kua kahawa yangu isingewezekana

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:21.776
bila ma mia ya watu
ninowachukulia poa.

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:23.696
Hivyo ningemshukuru dereva lori

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:26.416
alieendesha kahawa 
kwenda kwenye duka la kahawa.

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:29.736
Lakini asingeweza kufanya kazi yake
bila barabara.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:32.656
Hivyo ningeshukuru watu
waliotengeneza barabara.